   "consejo": "The z sounds th: thum-BI-do. It comes from «zumbar».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "mareos",
   "significado": "dizzy spells",
   "pron": "ma-RE-os",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "noun",
   "genero": "m",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It comes from «mar»: the movement of a ship makes you dizzy. The singular is «el mareo».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
